    scenario: 'Three weeks in, she keeps cancelling, unsure whether he is more than a smooth talker. He never complains. Then her train is cancelled on the morning of her sister’s wedding, two hundred miles away. He drives through the night, gets her to the church with ten minutes to spare and leaves before the speeches. By Monday she is the one calling him.',
